# npm dist-tag rm melete-demo next

### read
GET https://registry.npmjs.org/-/package/melete-demo/dist-tags
authorization: Bearer melete-proxy-adds-this
npm-auth-type: web
npm-command: dist-tag
user-agent: npm/11.9.0 node/v24.14.0 win32 x64 workspaces/false
accept: */*

### write
DELETE https://registry.npmjs.org/-/package/melete-demo/dist-tags/next
user-agent: npm/11.9.0 node/v24.14.0 win32 x64 workspaces/false
npm-auth-type: web
npm-command: dist-tag
authorization: Bearer melete-proxy-adds-this
accept: */*
